3. Reference data (not redistributed)
================================================================================

The benchmark databases referenced by the evaluation pipeline are NOT included:

  * UniRef90            - UniProt Consortium, https://www.uniprot.org/help/downloads
  * ASTRAL 40% subset   - SCOPe, https://scop.berkeley.edu/downloads/
  * SCOPe lineage file  - SCOPe, https://scop.berkeley.edu/downloads/

Only a 112 KB smoke query set derived from the ASTRAL 40% subset (small enough
to be redistributed in accordance with SCOPe's terms) is included, under
workspace/seq_align/data_test/.

